<Information title="Privacy" description="How the Optimum Tech website handles visitor information.">
  <p>This notice covers the public website at optimum.ba. Linked websites and services have their own privacy notices.</p>
  <h2>Hosting and analytics</h2>
  <p>Cloudflare Pages serves this website. Its delivery and security services receive the network information needed to respond to web requests. Read the <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare privacy policy</a> for its processing practices.</p>
  <p>The production site uses Plausible for website analytics. About, Contact and Privacy do not load the analytics script. The <a href="https://plausible.io/data-policy">Plausible data policy</a> explains its measurement and storage practices.</p>
  <h2>Email</h2>
  <p>Contact links open your email client. If you email us, your message and contact details are handled through the email service used for that conversation. Please do not send passwords, access tokens or unnecessary sensitive information.</p>
  <p>For privacy questions or corrections, email <a href="mailto:consulting@optimum.ba">consulting@optimum.ba</a>.</p>
  <p>Last reviewed: 7 October 2026.</p>
</Information>
